{"id":"n58301-1-10","stage":1,"title":"별로 · 不太","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58301-1-10-1","ko":"주사 맞을 때 많이 아팠니?","zh":"打针的时候很疼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주사","meaning":"注射","explanation":"주사：注射。","readings":[{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91770","senseId":"1","lemma":"주사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"맞을","meaning":"打针","explanation":"맞다：打针；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞을","audio":"/audio/3abd0141b99bb277a613.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"아팠니?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아팠니","audio":"/audio/21ac56e106f12e2327cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32b004ef02722e1b","term":"주사","zh":"注射","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3","entryId":"91770","definition":"用注射器直接往人或动物体内注射药液。","pronunciation":["주ː사"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打针","audi